      "id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0008",
      "source_line": 10,
      "source_atom": "- 只詢問或盤點 → 唯讀，不移動、不改標籤、不改已讀狀態。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0008"
    },
    {
      "id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0009",
      "source_line": 11,
      "source_atom": "- 重要信檢查（使用者要的節奏是每天早晚；排程另行設定，本 Skill 不自行新增排程）→ 唯讀，列出帳單到期、扣款失敗、補件、工作往來四類，附寄件者、日期、需要的動作。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
