    {
      "id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0011",
      "source_line": 14,
      "source_atom": "## 2. 清理判定（全部成立才移）",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0011"
    },
    {
      "id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0012",
      "source_line": 15,
      "source_atom": "1. 寄送時間超過三個曆月：以台北時間計算截止日（例：今天 10/23 → 截止 7/23），不得簡化成 90 天。月份沒有那一天時夾到該月最後一天（例：今天 5/31 → 截止 2/28，閏年 2/29）；截止日當天寄的信保留。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0012"
    },
    {
      "id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0013",
      "source_line": 16,
      "source_atom": "2. 逐封讀內文，確認是純行銷廣告，而且內容已過期。促銷內容夾帶交易、帳單、點數或仍有效票券的保留；附件沒讀到的保留。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0013"
    },
    {
      "id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0014",
      "source_line": 17,
      "source_atom": "3. 以單封郵件判定，不連帶整串。工具只能整串操作時，整串每一封都符合才動，否則保留。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0014"
    },
    {
      "id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0015",
      "source_line": 18,
      "source_atom": "4. 不確定就保留。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0015"
    },
    {
      "id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0016",
      "source_line": 19,
      "source_atom": "5. 動手前再讀一次確認；移動後逐封讀回；結果不明先讀回查證，不盲目重試。讀回發現搬錯就立刻從垃圾桶移回原處並回報；該搬沒搬到的列出來，下一批再處理。",
      "candidate_anchor": "references/pre-format-candidate-SKILL.md or S1-S4",
      "mapping_status": "MAPPED",
      "source_atom_id": "GMAIL-CLEANUP-0016"
    },
